## 🎯 **13. SUCCESS METRICS & GOALS**

### **User Experience Goals**
1. **Performance Targets**
   - **Page Load Time**: < 2s
   - **User Satisfaction**: > 4.5/5
   - **Task Success Rate**: > 90%
